  "question": {
    "text": "The value of \\(\\lim _{n \\rightarrow \\infty}\\left[\\left(\\frac{1}{2 \\cdot 3}+\\frac{1}{2^2 \\cdot 3}\\right)+\\left(\\frac{1}{2^2 \\cdot 3^2}+\\frac{1}{2^3 \\cdot 3^2}\\right)+\\ldots+\\left(\\frac{1}{2^n \\cdot 3^n}+\\frac{1}{2^{n+1} \\cdot 3^n}\\right)\\right]\\) is",
